    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/ec4968943b5d65b9ed23c1bcb07fcfbb.poster.avif?t=1752718578\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/ec4968943b5d65b9ed23c1bcb07fcfbb.webm?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/ec4968943b5d65b9ed23c1bcb07fcfbb.mp4?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong> Content Overview </strong> </h2><br>Game Designer Simulator is a pixel game based on real-life themes, with a non-linear storyline and card battles. Players will take on the role of a newly graduated college student in a fictional city based on Shanghai, experiencing everything from interviews to becoming a novice Game Designer, and improving themselves under various pressures in the workplace; The ultimate dream journey to become a game producer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/76166f18155048ae281cfd9d482ce765.poster.avif?t=1752718578\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/76166f18155048ae281cfd9d482ce765.webm?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/76166f18155048ae281cfd9d482ce765.mp4?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u00b7Exquisite hand drawn pixel paintings<br>Hand drawn pixels with full details, including vehicles, pedestrians, markets, and flying animals; With a plethora of details, you can immerse yourself in every day of the elevated Luoshandu neighborhood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/713cc2b70430c3b6a02367d561353c16.poster.avif?t=1752718578\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/713cc2b70430c3b6a02367d561353c16.webm?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/713cc2b70430c3b6a02367d561353c16.mp4?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u00b7Interactive content with rich details<br>It would be a pity if you can't play with such a detailed picture! Rich interactive content has been added to the scene, and the protagonist currently has over 80 action expressions, which are still being intensified!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/077640b3e5bc27881c28d981f1f53dc9.poster.avif?t=1752718578\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/077640b3e5bc27881c28d981f1f53dc9.webm?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967710/extras/077640b3e5bc27881c28d981f1f53dc9.mp4?t=1752718578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u00b7A non-linear narrative with intricate plot twists and turns<br>If anything can make this world more interesting, it must be an impressive story! Interesting dialogues, exciting performances, and every choice may change your future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2>\u00b7Clever design for card battles<br>\u00b7Create your dream game as you please<br>\u00b7Recruiting partners to 